### Create a new Website
POST http://localhost:5000/api/websites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "domain": "https://example.com"
}

### Get all Websites
GET http://localhost:5000/api/websites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get a single Website by ID (replace :id with actual ID from previous request)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/websites/:id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Test Validation Error (Invalid domain)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/websites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "domain": "not-a-domain"
}
